{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_01F9B0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"一旦被发现并进入警戒状态，敌人有时会呼叫增援攻击部队。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"这些家伙装备精良、行动敏捷，非常危险。阿曼达他们称之为“突击兵”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"和巡逻兵不同，这些家伙会主动追踪你，非要把你猎出来不可。就像凶猛的<R=猎犬,hound>一样。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=猎犬,hound>","cn_utf8_bytes":124,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"猎犬来猎杀前FOXHOUND成员吗……正合我意。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"就算跟丢了你，他们也不会轻易放弃，还会对可能的藏身处进行<R= 扫荡 ,clearing>。","cn_control_tokens":"<R= 扫荡 ,clearing>","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED;SOURCE_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"就算觉得自己藏好了，一大意也可能再次被发现。时刻盯着他们的动向。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"另外，突击兵的装备里也有防弹衣。碰上这种家伙，胡乱扫射也解决不了问题。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"AUX_SECOND_SENTENCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"只要瞄准暴露出来的弱点射击就行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"对，就这么做。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""}]}